# W4bs, b (k5, a stranger): W4b's b (takes the gate 6 s after a), whose pass stalls 6.3 s at the relay's first hold
# (DW4_ONLINE_TEST_BARRIER_STALL). It must be a's guest within 60 s of its arrival; else (W4bsx) its script fails and ends.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@106
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b in stag0101
follow 40 until present=2 or waited>=60 fail waited>=59
follow 40 until present=2,sealed>=4000 or present<=1 fail stagechange
log together
idle until frames>=60
